  {"subject": "English", "year": 2070, "question": "Choose the option that correctly completes: 'Hardly ___ the meeting begun when it started raining.'", "options": ["had", "has", "did", "was"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "'Hardly' at the start of a sentence causes inversion with the past perfect 'had'."},
